  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<div><span><span>In </span><span>late-February</span><span>&nbsp;2025</span></span><span><span>, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></div><ul><li><p><span><span>Elevate your SQL queries with new T-SQL features: </span><span>regular </span><span>expression</span><span>s</span><span>&nbsp;(r</span><span>egex</span><span>)</span><span>, </span><span>f</span><span>uzzy string-matching, and </span></span><span><span>bigint</span></span><span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>support in DATEADD. </span></span></p></li></ul><div><p><a href=\"https://aka.ms/regex-fuzzy-match\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a>.</p><br></div>",
    "Markdown": "In late-February 2025 , the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:\n\nElevate your SQL queries with new T-SQL features: regular expression s (r egex ) , f uzzy string-matching, and bigint support in DATEADD.\n\nLearn more ."
